<title>USA: Ill. Superconductor declines comment on shr drop.</title>
<headline>Ill. Superconductor declines comment on shr drop.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT PROSPECT, Ill. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Illinois Superconductor Corp said Friday it declined to speculate on specific causes for a recent decline in its stock price.</p>
<p>But the company said that some stock sales may have resulted from a recently reported distribution of shares by a significant stockholder limited partnership.  </p>
<p>Illinois Superconductor is commercializing high temperature superconducting technology for the wireless telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>Illinois Superconductor shares rose 1/8 at 9-1/2.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
